# Build output is committed on purpose: the DSH profile loader consumes
# `lib/` directly through the package `exports` map, and Phase 1 evidence is
# recorded against an exact build. Only dependencies and scratch state are
# ignored.
node_modules/
*.tgz

# Verification scratch space (isolated DSH homes, cookie jars, probe output).
.tmp/
verify-out/

# The Phase 3 fixture database is *generated*, not authored: every row in it is
# a literal in `src/host/fixture.ts`, and `scripts/build-fixture-db.mjs`
# reproduces it from those literals. The host also materialises it on first open,
# so a fresh clone needs no committed binary. The `-journal`/`-wal`/`-shm` forms
# are SQLite's own scratch files.
fixtures/*.db
fixtures/*.db-journal
fixtures/*.db-wal
fixtures/*.db-shm

# Editor / OS noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
